{"ts":"2026-11-16T22:30:09.118Z","tool":"execute_code","type":"tool","status":"SUCCESS","ms":1359,"action":"execute","params":{"action":"execute","code":"var go = new GameObject(\"TestLight\", typeof(Light));\nvar l = go.GetComponent<Light>();\nl.type = LightType.Directional;\nl.transform.rotation = Quaternion.Euler(35f, 110f, 0f);\nl.intensity = 1.25f;\nl.color = new Color(1.0f, 0.96f, 0.88f);\nl.shadows = LightShadows.Soft;\nl.shadowStrength = 0.85f;\nl.shadowResolution = UnityEngine.Rendering.LightShadowResolution.High;\nl.shadowBias = 0.05f;\nl.shadowNormalBias = 0.4f;\nl.lightmapBakeType = LightmapBakeType.Realtime;\n\nvar result = string.Format(\"Type: {0}, Rot: {1}, Intensity: {2}, Color: {3}, Shadows: {4}, Strength: {5}, Res: {6}, Bias: {7}, NormalBias: {8}, Bake: {9}\",\n    l.type, l.transform.eulerAngles, l.intensity, l.color, l.shadows, l.shadowStrength, l.shadowResolution, l.shadowBias, l.shadowNormalBias, l.lightmapBakeType);\n\nGameObject.DestroyImmediate(go);\nreturn result;","safety_checks":true,"compiler":"auto"}}
