{"ts":"2026-11-16T23:06:59.583Z","tool":"execute_code","type":"tool","status":"SUCCESS","ms":8528,"action":"execute","params":{"action":"execute","code":"var layer = UnityEditor.AssetDatabase.LoadAssetAtPath<UnityEngine.TerrainLayer>(\"Assets/TerrainLayers/Layer_Asfalto.terrainlayer\");\nvar norm = UnityEditor.AssetDatabase.LoadAssetAtPath<UnityEngine.Texture2D>(\"Assets/Models/IFNMG/Textures/Nucleo Melhorado (Modelo Pesado)/hexagonal_concrete_paving_nor_gl_1k.exr.exr\");\nvar diff = UnityEditor.AssetDatabase.LoadAssetAtPath<UnityEngine.Texture2D>(\"Assets/Models/IFNMG/Textures/Nucleo Melhorado (Modelo Pesado)/hexagonal_concrete_paving_diff_1k.jpg.jpg\");\n\n// Check importer of normal\nvar imp = UnityEditor.AssetImporter.GetAtPath(UnityEditor.AssetDatabase.GetAssetPath(norm)) as UnityEditor.TextureImporter;\nif (imp != null && imp.textureType != UnityEditor.TextureImporterType.NormalMap) {\n    imp.textureType = UnityEditor.TextureImporterType.NormalMap;\n    imp.SaveAndReimport();\n}\n\nlayer.diffuseTexture = diff;\nlayer.normalMapTexture = norm;\nUnityEditor.EditorUtility.SetDirty(layer);\nUnityEditor.AssetDatabase.SaveAssets();\n\nreturn \"Updated Layer_Asfalto to: \" + diff.name + \" with Normal: \" + norm.name;","safety_checks":true,"compiler":"auto"}}
